window.bookSummaryJSON = "An undercover FBI agent searching for a serial killer realizes he'd been embedded with an outlaw motorcycle club too long after it begins to affect his life choices. It all comes to a head when he meets the right woman at the wrong time. Contains sensitive material relating to biker life, such as adult language, drugs, drinking, assault and death, and other aspects of life in an outlaw motorcycle club. Meant for mature readers."; 
